        "testata": "France 24",
        "lingua_originale": "en",
        "titolo_orig": "'Strategy of ecological terror. Desalination as a weapon of war' in the Middle East",
        "testo_it": "Analisi sull'uso della desalinizzazione come arma di guerra nel conflitto in Medio Oriente.",
        "priorita": "Media",
        "id_gruppo": 1,
        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/strategy-of-ecological-terror-desalination-as-a-weapon-of-war-in-the-middle-east",
        "orario": "13:18",
        "timestamp": 1775042339,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. 'Strategy of ecological terror. Desalination as a weapon of war' in the Middle East Middle East Issued on: 01/04/2026 - 13:18 Modified: 01/04/2026 - 13:20 Eve Irvine is pleased to welcome Dr. Michael Christopher Low, Associate Professor of History and Director of the Middle East Center at the University of Utah. As a historian of infrastructure and environmental systems in the Middle East, his work examines how seemingly technical systems, like desalination, become deeply embedded in geopolitical strategy, including in wartime. In his forthcoming book \"Saltwater Kingdoms\", he argues that water infrastructure in the Gulf is not merely a tool of survival, but a central axis of political leverage and vulnerability. US journalist Shelly Kittleson kidnapped in Iraq 01/04/2026 Middle East Death penalty 'a deep stain on the law books of the state of Israel' 01/04/2026 Middle East ‘Blatantly racist’: Death penalty law among 'worst legislation' in Israeli parliamentary history 01/04/2026 Middle East As US pursues 'maximalist demands', Iran relies on four decades of asymmetric warfare 01/04/2026 Middle East Gulf allies privately make the case to Trump to keep fighting until Iran is decisively defeated 31/03/2026 Middle East Europe pushes back on US military operations as concerns over Iran war mount 31/03/2026 Middle East Israel to occupy swaths of south Lebanon and destroy houses near border 31/03/2026 Middle East Iran desalination plant in the Strait of Hormuz out of service following strikes 31/03/2026 Middle East Israel to destroy all houses in South Lebanon buffer-zone 31/03/2026 Middle East"
